  "description": "A production-ready .NET 10 dotnet new template implementing the Hybrid Modular Monolith + Vertical Slices architecture.\n      Includes an ASP.NET Core Web API, .NET Aspire orchestration, pre-wired modules (Catalog, Identity, Orders, Notifications),\n      a Result pattern, FluentValidation pipeline, EF Core with SQL Server, and optional scripts and config files.",
